{"version":1,"content":"<p>【注意 ⚠️】Microsoft 官方正式宣布，將自 2027 年 1 月起，於 Windows 系統中預設全面封鎖採用 ReFS（彈性檔案系統，Resilient File System）格式的 USB 隨身碟及外接儲存裝置。</p><p>該項政策將涵蓋 Windows 11、仍處於支援週期的 Windows 10 以及 Windows Server 系統。</p><p>雖然受影響的裝置不會因此遺失內部儲存資料，但將無法直接於 Windows 中掛載與存取。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T07:39:40.289577+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:12:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T12:57:49.806790+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T07:37:44.319516+00:00","content_hash":"64b5b727c645983c5ebc5c034b889283e89f2131256b87192965ef59858204f6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}